<title>UK: Essen Hypo prices 1.0 billion mark five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Essen Hypo prices 1.0 billion mark five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond announced earlier by joint lead managers ABN AMRO, DG Bank, HSBC Trinkaus and Norddeutsche Landesbank, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HYPOTHEKENBANK IN ESSEN AG</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.75	MATURITY    16.APR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.33     PAY DATE    16.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  25 BP     REOFFER    99.16     SPREAD	+27 BP</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 10	  LISTING  DUESSELDORF PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND BOBL 121</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
